EmbeddingResponse.description:
OpenAI compatible response to an embedding request.
```
{
    "object": "list",
    "data": [
        {
            "object": "embedding",
            "embedding": [<list of floats>],
            "index": 0
        },
        {
            "object": "embedding",
            "embedding": [<list of floats>],
            "index": 1
        }
    ],
    "model": "nomic-ai/nomic-embed-text-v1.5-GGUF/nomic-embed-text-v1.5.f32.gguf",
    "usage": {
        "prompt_tokens": 0,
        "total_tokens": 0
    }
}
```

post.description:
Chat endpoint with streaming response.
Streams newline-delimited JSON matching the Ollama format:
{"message": {"content": "token"}, "done": false, "model": "llama3.2"}
